\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Study-selection flowchart with the two-tier design. Records were retrieved from the Crossref REST API on 4--5 September 2026 (five passes; January--May 2024 retrieval hole documented in Section II-A), deduplicated, screened at title level by a released mechanical keyword rule (883 retained, 667 excluded), then at venue and document-type level. Tier 1 includes every eligible record (799, rule-based, no quotas); Tier 2 carries a curated full-text-classified subset of 103 with six landmark studies included deliberately and five force-included individually from outside the pool. Record-level provenance is released as screening\_log.csv (all 1,550 decisions) and tagging\_terms.json.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:fig2_prisma.png}{{2}{4}{}{figure.2}{}}
